{"4005260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Don't Belong Here", "steam_appid": 4005260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU DON’T BELONG HERE – BUT SOMEHOW IT WORKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don't belong here, nothing about you does</strong> – not your flat little body, not the sideways way you move, not the way you flicker when the world gets too close. But it’s all falling apart anyway: textures peeling, geometry losing its grip, whole rooms forgetting how to hold their shape. After all, not belonging to such a broken world might be the only to make it.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/197ea9a7b7b63f9cada18fd199ff3c02.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/197ea9a7b7b63f9cada18fd199ff3c02.webm?t=1787867732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/e510878b1f30b60e24f486ddca2b10c0.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/e510878b1f30b60e24f486ddca2b10c0.webm?t=1787867732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/186b0ff85e82448ae35a65d301749828.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/186b0ff85e82448ae35a65d301749828.webm?t=1787867732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/324f0359e9807cb03f46702326d89dbe.webp?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/324f0359e9807cb03f46702326d89dbe.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this metroidvania adventure, explore unknown realms after leaving the comfort of your own familiar game. Be the very definition of what works even when it's not supposed to, as you uncover one piece after another. It’s a bit like reverse-engineering a game you want to explore from every angle – differently each time.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/bb2b69aeae8db5be6d67721e352cda98.avif?t=1787867732\" alt=\"banner_1\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras_big/bb2b69aeae8db5be6d67721e352cda98.webp?t=1787867732 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A LOVE LETTER TO THE HISTORY OF GAME ART</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through a world of mismatched art styles from the realistic to the to the super stylized and everything in between. If you survive long enough he might even be able to learn some new art styles yourself and braved the world in you never thought possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/d7cc8b36a7f84a04bc983bc773919ec6.webp?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/d7cc8b36a7f84a04bc983bc773919ec6.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/3735cf5fcc4e51c760419b951233b9b1.gif?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/3735cf5fcc4e51c760419b951233b9b1.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/80fae72707d9ea437f1a328137e93441.gif?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/80fae72707d9ea437f1a328137e93441.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/d8570ea74f99b0b46e39765a2ef5c4c6.gif?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/d8570ea74f99b0b46e39765a2ef5c4c6.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DON’T JUST FIGHT IT – BREAK IT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat here has a body count you can see and every hit matters more than ever. Enemies lose detail as they take damage – geometry cracking, movement glitching out. Take too many hits yourself and watch your own resolution drop, your hitbox starts to slip loose from your sprite. Losing is visible, right up until the final blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/2d7f2baf13195f6407b675ae52ded19c.avif?t=1787867732\" alt=\"banner_2\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras_big/2d7f2baf13195f6407b675ae52ded19c.webp?t=1787867732 width=1560 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DEFINE WHAT APPLIES TO YOU, EVEN IF IT DIDN’T BEFORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New abilities that you gain along the way map onto the axes of the world itself: a dash along one, a throw along another, a flip through a third. Every unlock is a small negotiation with a space you weren't made to move through. Playful risky and utterly confused, this is the best To get through this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/14b12e6875c44b6a0e6f0a1c0bc9ad86.webp?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/14b12e6875c44b6a0e6f0a1c0bc9ad86.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience different visual styles</strong> and go with the flow – or fight against it. Every style has its own rules, and after all, rules are sometimes meant to be broken... You are the one who decides what works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight and outglitch your enemies</strong>. Every hit will show you who’s on the top. And no, not on the health bar… Your rivals will first lose visual fidelity, eventually turning into a grid of shapes. And you might be next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New movement and combat abilities map onto the axes of 3D space itself</strong> – Double Jump, Dash, Throw, Spin, and Flip – each one another small negotiation with a dimension you were never built for. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take risks and open up new paths</strong>. The metroidvania-style world won’t let you discover every route on your first try, but nothing’s stopping you from trying to squeeze through here and there. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive in a focused, complete experience</strong>. No padding, no filler, every hour earns its place. This world is designed so that you’ll want to explore it again – faster and more deeply each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The tone is sardonic, melancholic, and self-aware.</strong> The people you meet speak in warped rendering jargon – LODs, MIPs, wireframes – turning the language of game development into the voice of the world talking back at you, reminding you constantly that you don't belong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/2a9cfe08d2ba64df24ededbdc1b22f87.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/2a9cfe08d2ba64df24ededbdc1b22f87.webm?t=1787867732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>YOU DON’T BELONG HERE – BUT SOMEHOW IT WORKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don't belong here, nothing about you does</strong> – not your flat little body, not the sideways way you move, not the way you flicker when the world 