hat you gain along the way map onto the axes of the world itself: a dash along one, a throw along another, a flip through a third. Every unlock is a small negotiation with a space you weren't made to move through. Playful risky and utterly confused, this is the best To get through this.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/14b12e6875c44b6a0e6f0a1c0bc9ad86.webp?t=1787867732\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/14b12e6875c44b6a0e6f0a1c0bc9ad86.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=256 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GAME FEATURES </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience different visual styles</strong> and go with the flow – or fight against it. Every style has its own rules, and after all, rules are sometimes meant to be broken... You are the one who decides what works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight and outglitch your enemies</strong>. Every hit will show you who’s on the top. And no, not on the health bar… Your rivals will first lose visual fidelity, eventually turning into a grid of shapes. And you might be next. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New movement and combat abilities map onto the axes of 3D space itself</strong> – Double Jump, Dash, Throw, Spin, and Flip – each one another small negotiation with a dimension you were never built for. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take risks and open up new paths</strong>. The metroidvania-style world won’t let you discover every route on your first try, but nothing’s stopping you from trying to squeeze through here and there. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive in a focused, complete experience</strong>. No padding, no filler, every hour earns its place. This world is designed so that you’ll want to explore it again – faster and more deeply each time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The tone is sardonic, melancholic, and self-aware.</strong> The people you meet speak in warped rendering jargon – LODs, MIPs, wireframes – turning the language of game development into the voice of the world talking back at you, reminding you constantly that you don't belong.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/2a9cfe08d2ba64df24ededbdc1b22f87.poster.avif?t=1787867732\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/extras/2a9cfe08d2ba64df24ededbdc1b22f87.webm?t=1787867732\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "short_description": "You're an 8-bit character adrift in a 3D world dissolving under its own weight. Journey through a fading nihilistic world you don't belong to and explore what it feels like not to fit in and to keep going anyway.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/b9caded6d9a9f41d71483d60ad18f6d2cc9f3862/header.jpg?t=1787867732", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/63cc240c1a0c28964fce438d9db3845b0239a06d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787867732", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005260/63cc240c1a0c28964fce438d9db3845b0239a06d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787867732", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum: